%% Azure Backup for Azure file shares behind File Sync - data paths, tiers and restores - Contoso profile
%% Source: codex/blueprint-azure-files-backup-protection.md (Microsoft Learn: About Azure Files backup; Restore Azure Files; support matrix)
flowchart LR
  subgraph Azure[Azure - every backup flow is Azure-internal]
    SA[("Storage account - shares home, dept, archive - share soft delete 14 d")]
    SNAP[Share snapshots - every 4 h, 30 days - leased by Backup]
    RSV[Recovery Services vault - GRS + cross-region restore - soft delete always-on - immutability locked - MUA]
    VLT[Vault-standard tier - daily 90 d, monthly 12, yearly 7 - offsite, immutable]
    AL[Azure Monitor alerts - all job failures to action group]
    LA[("Log Analytics - Backup reports")]
    PAIR[("Paired region - cross-region restore target")]
  end
  subgraph Contoso[Contoso]
    FS[File Sync servers - private path over ExpressRoute]
    ADM[Backup admin - portal / PowerShell]
  end
  SA -->|scheduled snapshot| SNAP
  SNAP -->|changed blocks of the last daily snapshot| VLT
  RSV --- VLT
  RSV --> AL
  RSV --> LA
  SNAP -->|item-level restore, original or alternate| SA
  SNAP -->|full-share restore| SA
  VLT -->|full-share restore to alternate location, 20% free space| SA
  VLT -->|cross-region restore| PAIR
  SA -->|File Sync change detection for restored paths| FS
  ADM -.->|management plane only| RSV
